      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْرُوسٌ</span></b>  [<i>Uttered with a sound:</i> or <i>with a low,
gentle, slight,</i> or <i>soft, sound</i>]. Every letter of the
alphabet is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْرُوسَة</span>, except the soft letters, (A,
TA,) namely, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وا</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>. (TA.)

